@startuml
left to right direction

rectangle "Runtime" as runtime
rectangle "Sensor Sources" as sensors
rectangle "State Manager\n(LWW + delta view)" as state
rectangle "Membership Manager\n(+ failure detection)" as membership
rectangle "Replication Runtime\n(push-pull + full sync fallback)" as replication
rectangle "Observability Service" as observability
rectangle "API Clients" as api

runtime --> sensors : starts/manages
runtime --> state : manages
runtime --> membership : manages
runtime --> replication : schedules
runtime --> observability : exposes

sensors --> state : local updates
replication --> membership : reads alive peers
replication --> state : remote updates / sync

state --> observability : state snapshot
membership --> observability : membership snapshot
observability --> api : read-only HTTP

note bottom
No direct dependency between Membership Manager and State Manager.
They are coordinated by runtime and replication flows.
end note
@enduml
